  "source_segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0002",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 2,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0002",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：00：14"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0003",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 3,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0003",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：听说是敌人来的一个骑兵联队，说有五六百匹马，骑兵联队他们下面没有大队，他可能就直接是骑兵中队。咱们跟东北军打仗的时候，他那个骑兵也是直接四个连，下面没有营，估计日本人那个编制可能也是没有营，他联队是等于咱们的团。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0004",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 4,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0004",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：01：02"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0005",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 5,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0005",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：他不让我过嘛，我就只好往回走啊，结果这个飞机来了，飞得很矮，他也没有开枪，我就手枪也打不着（杨永松笑）。我想，因为我说他妈你飞这么低啊，你手枪就打三十米左右二十五米，他飞怎么样也有上百米高啊。我就又躲到那个水沟里看一会儿。这个时候，日本飞机十几架，可能是一个什么编队吧，往南去了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0006",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 6,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0006",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：02：00"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0007",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 7,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0007",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：过了不久又回来了。当时不知怎么往回来了，（其实）他是看见中央军的飞机往回跑，他跑了以后不远，后面咱们的飞机来了。结果中央军这个飞机追追追，他也追不上了。日本飞机跑了，中央军的飞机又回来了，回来以后看见我们下面缴的汽车，一百多辆，摆好长一溜呢。据说是这车上还有一门炮，这个炮是谁弄上的我不知道，反正我们那个团没有弄到，我们团在这边（杨永松往左边比划）。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0008",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 8,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0008",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：03：02"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0009",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 9,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0009",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：有一门75步兵炮，这么长的（杨永松两手示意）。另外那个炮弹呢，老百姓说堆得跟山一样，就堆得比较高啊。我碰见教导（音）那个被服一蒙（音）……但是我们不认识啊，这么大家伙，那么长，他扛着好几个回来。所以炮弹、步机枪子弹、粮食、干粮这些物资啊，堆积如山，形容是这样的，堆得很长。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0010",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 10,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0010",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：04：02"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0011",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 11,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0011",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：所以这个中央军飞机回来以后，他撂了几个炸弹，也不知道撂准没有，我这看不见，就光知道那边“咣咣”的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0012",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 12,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0012",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：他不是炸咱们这边吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0013",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 13,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0013",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：中央军他炸那个公路上的车啊。好像那个时候，第二天（还是）哪一天啊，就有意识地要撤。因为敌人增援已经来了，但是不知道有多少。我看见冒烟了，很高，大概就烧那个汽车了。687团上去以后，他就把他的骑兵就打退了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0014",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 14,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0014",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：05：05"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0015",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 15,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0015",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：后面没有步兵跟上，他的骑兵一打就跑了。那天晚上呢，686团继续攻老爷庙，我们685团就攻东、西跑池。据我了解东、西跑池的（日本）人非常顽强，咱们接近村子就伤亡很大，所以那天晚上我们没有达到歼灭村子的敌人的目的。所以在第二天呢，天亮以前我们部队撤到这个……跟敌人脱离接触，退到这边山头上来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0016",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 16,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0016",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：06：10"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0017",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 17,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0017",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：您要过去的时候，那个时候前方还在打仗是吧？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0018",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 18,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0018",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：打得不狠。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0019",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 19,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0019",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：不很激烈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0020",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 20,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0020",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：不很激烈。因为敌人休息，咱们爬到山头上也就休息了，也不露头，露头他就开枪。咱们过去脑子不动，其实这个部队休息的时候啊，他都有值班部队，值班的机枪，值班的掷弹筒。咱们那个时候，除了手榴弹以外没有掷弹筒，没有炮。本来长征的时候师里团里就没有炮了，师改成团以后就没有炮了，一军团有一个炮兵营。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0021",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 21,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0021",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：07：06"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0022",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 22,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0022",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：师，原来叫军，军改为师，师改为团以后，师、团都没有炮，原因就是没有炮弹。扛着那个管子没用，迫击炮。你要有的话，你打仗的时候能缴到炮弹的情况底下，也可能缴到炮，所以不愁没有炮，只要有炮弹就不愁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0023",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 23,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0023",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "记者：那就说在打平型关的时候咱们连炮都没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0024",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 24,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0024",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "杨永松：我的印象里，我们685团没炮。军团没有炮兵营了，一军团到陕北的路上还有炮兵营。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0025",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 25,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0025",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：08：07"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0026",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 26,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0026",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：好像到了陕北以后啊，就没有炮兵营了。因为我们打直罗镇的时候，我们打进去，敌人突出来的时候，我们那天消灭他一个团，敌人是比较集中的，军团有炮弹不打他吗？没有，就是军团的防空排两挺机枪打了。我的印象，我们一军团……徐海东那个旅343旅有没有炮啊我不知道。那个车上听说有一门75步兵炮，这个炮是谁弄去了，也闹不清楚。因为我这个范围有限。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0027",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 27,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0027",
      "speaker_type": "EDITOR",
      "segment_type": "RECORDING_TIMESTAMP",
      "verbatim_text": "    00：09：03"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0028",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 28,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0028",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWER",
      "segment_type": "INTERVIEWER_PROMPT",
      "verbatim_text": "    记者：对，那个时候您这也提到了，在缴获物资的时候，有辆摩托车想推回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "BATCH02-DOC04-S0029",
      "document_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx",
      "technical_document_id": "BATCH02-DOC04",
      "segment_order": 29,
      "part": "document",
      "source_block_id": "03.杨永松100506（二校后 阅读版）.docx-B0029",
      "speaker_type": "INTERVIEWEE",
      "segment_type": "ORAL_TESTIMONY",
      "verbatim_text": "    杨永松：因为第二天我就碰见师的指挥所，他从前面回来，我不是还往前走的时候他就往后去。推了三辆摩托车，谁也不会开，谁也不懂啊，这一推“嘣咚嘣咚嘣咚嘣咚嘣咚”响了，你一停它又不响了。我记得是第三天的傍晚啊，我们部队就撤下来了。"
    }
  ]
}
